 0\\n                    }\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[5].notes\", \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[0].notes\", \"old\": \" [Merged 2 duplicates: 0.997009, 4.0]\", \"new\": \"Superseded flattening history, not a current amount: [Merged 2 duplicates: 0.997009, 4.0]\\n\\nSource batch input: 4 g. Keep the mass in notes; neither input water nor API volume/g_l encoding establishes a measured final volume. No g/L concentration is asserted. The old combined yeast amount mixed basal and sludge preparation stages. Keep their independent inputs separate; incubation and centrifugation do not prove quantitative yeast transfer to the final medium.\", \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/119\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n                        \\\"recipe_order\\\": 1,\\n                        \\\"compound\\\": \\\"Yeast extract\\\",\\n                        \\\"compound_id\\\": 16,\\n                        \\\"amount\\\": 4,\\n                        \\\"unit\\\": \\\"g\\\",\\n                        \\\"g_l\\\": 4,\\n                        \\\"optional\\\": 0\\n                    }\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[5].preferred_term\", \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[0].preferred_term\", \"old\": \"Yeast extract\", \"new\": \"Yeast extract\", \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/119\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n                        \\\"recipe_order\\\": 1,\\n                        \\\"compound\\\": \\\"Yeast extract\\\",\\n                        \\\"compound_id\\\": 16,\\n                        \\\"amount\\\": 4,\\n                        \\\"unit\\\": \\\"g\\\",\\n                        \\\"g_l\\\": 4,\\n                        \\\"optional\\\": 0\\n                    }\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[0].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Superseded flattening history, not a current amount: [Merged 2 duplicates: 0.997009, 4.0]\\n\\nSource batch input: 4 g. Keep the mass in notes; neither input water nor API volume/g_l encoding establishes a measured final volume. No g/L concentration is asserted. The old combined yeast amount mixed basal and sludge preparation stages. Keep their independent inputs separate; incubation and centrifugation do not prove quantitative yeast transfer to the final medium.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium119.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Yeast extract                                                        4.00          g\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[12].concentration\", \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[1].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"1000\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"new\": {\"value\": \"1\", \"unit\": \"L\"}, \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/119\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n                        \\\"recipe_order\\\": 2,\\n                        \\\"compound\\\": \\\"Sludge\\\",\\n                        \\\"compound_id\\\": 2084,\\n                        \\\"amount\\\": 1000,\\n                        \\\"unit\\\": \\\"ml\\\",\\n                        \\\"optional\\\": 0\\n                    }\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[12].notes\", \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[1].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Preparation input: 1000 ml = 1 L. This is input volume, not a mass, stock dose or measured final-volume denominator.\", \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/119\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n                        \\\"recipe_order\\\": 2,\\n                        \\\"compound\\\": \\\"Sludge\\\",\\n                        \\\"compound_id\\\": 2084,\\n                        \\\"amount\\\": 1000,\\n                        \\\"unit\\\": \\\"ml\\\",\\n                        \\\"optional\\\": 0\\n                    }\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[12].preferred_term\", \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[1].preferred_term\", \"old\": \"Sludge\", \"new\": \"Sludge\", \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/119\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n                        \\\"recipe_order\\\": 2,\\n                        \\\"compound\\\": \\\"Sludge\\\",\\n                        \\\"compound_id\\\": 2084,\\n                        \\\"amount\\\": 1000,\\n                        \\\"unit\\\": \\\"ml\\\",\\n                        \\\"optional\\\": 0\\n                    }\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[2].composition[1].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Preparation input: 1000 ml = 1 L. This is input volume, not a mass, stock dose or measured final-volume denominator.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium119.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sludge                                                          1000.00          ml\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[2].preparation_notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Add 0.4% yeast extract to sludge from an anaerobic digester, and after gassing with nitrogen gas for a few minutes incubate it at 37\\u00b0C for 24 hours. Then centrifuge the sludge at 13000 g and autoclave the resulting, clear supernatant in screw-capped vessels under nitrogen gas. The sludge fluid can be stored at 8-12\\u00b0C in the dark.\", \"status\": \"add\", \"reference\": \"https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/119\", \"snippet\": \"\\\"Add 0.4% yeast extract to sludge from an anaerobic digester, and after gassing with nitrogen gas for a few minutes incubate it at 37\\\\u00b0C for 24 hours. Then centrifuge the sludge at 13000 g and autoclave the resulting, clear supernatant in screw-capped vessels under nitrogen gas. The sludge fluid can be stored at 8-12\\\\u00b0C in the dark.\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[3].concentration\", \"old\": null, \"new\": {\"value\": \"0.02\", \"unit\": \"L\"}, \"status\": \"add\", \"r