lutions prepared under 100% N2 gas. Prior to use check pH of complete medium and adjust to 6.8 - 7.0, if necessary.\"\npreparation_steps: Only the main-stage instructions remain at recipe root; stock preparation instructions are preserved on their named solution descriptors. No unstated density, final volume, percent basis or chemical identifier is inferred. Locator=data.solutions[0].steps[0].step; accessed=2026-10-09T02:29:12.183202+00:00; capture SHA256=2ef0379b2f6f083499de9281386d962be27ba59fcba5135710f46288227d666e.\n\nAdditional exact excerpt: \"Note: After growth has started and the culture is becoming turbid add sterile 80% H2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture to 0.5 - 1 bar overpressure.\"\npreparation_steps: Only the main-stage instructions remain at recipe root; stock preparation instructions are preserved on their named solution descriptors. No unstated density, final volume, percent basis or chemical identifier is inferred. Locator=data.solutions[0].steps[1].step; accessed=2026-10-09T02:29:12.183202+00:00; capture SHA256=2ef0379b2f6f083499de9281386d962be27ba59fcba5135710f46288227d666e."
