and adjust to 6.8 - 7.0, if necessary.\"\npreparation_steps: Only the main-stage instructions remain at recipe root; stock preparation instructions are preserved on their named solution descriptors. No unstated density, final volume, percent basis or chemical identifier is inferred. Locator=data.solutions[0].steps[0].step; accessed=2026-10-09T02:29:20.378790+00:00; capture SHA256=e6fb6c737e1297709b90d4a1d7fbdc90870ce6cf52d8f47c291de24e952e970b."
