 \"isobutyric acid\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Tryptone\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"MICRO:0000182\", \"label\": \"tryptone\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"10.0\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"supplier_catalog\": {\"supplier_name\": \"Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.) LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\", \"catalog_number\": \"Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\", \"product_url\": \"https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\"}, \"notes\": \"Pancreatic digest of casein providing amino acids, peptides, and nitrogen; Constituent of LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation) commercial product\", \"synonyms\": [{\"synonym_text\": \"pancreatic digest of casein\", \"synonym_type\": \"EXACT\"}, {\"synonym_text\": \"casein peptone\", \"synonym_type\": \"EXACT\"}]}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Yeast extract\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"FOODON:03315426\", \"label\": \"yeast extract\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"5.0\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"supplier_catalog\": {\"supplier_name\": \"Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.) LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\", \"catalog_number\": \"Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\", \"product_url\": \"https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\"}, \"notes\": \"Autodigest of Saccharomyces cerevisiae providing vitamins, amino acids, and trace elements; Constituent of LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation) commercial product\"}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Sodium chloride\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:26710\", \"label\": \"sodium chloride\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"10.0\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"supplier_catalog\": {\"supplier_name\": \"Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.) LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\", \"catalog_number\": \"Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\", \"product_url\": \"https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\"}, \"notes\": \"Maintains osmotic equilibrium (Miller formulation); Constituent of LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation) commercial product\", \"synonyms\": [{\"synonym_text\": \"NaCl\", \"synonym_type\": \"EXACT\"}, {\"synonym_text\": \"table salt\", \"synonym_type\": \"EXACT\"}]}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Valeric acid\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:17418\", \"label\": \"valeric acid\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"27\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:17418\", \"label\": \"valeric acid\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Isovaleric acid\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:28484\", \"label\": \"isovaleric acid\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"27\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:28484\", \"label\": \"isovaleric acid\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"FeSO4 x 7 H2O\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:75836\", \"label\": \"iron(2+) sulfate heptahydrate\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"1\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:75836\", \"label\": \"iron(2+) sulfate heptahydrate\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"H2SO4\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:26836\", \"label\": \"sulfuric acid\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"1000\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:26836\", \"label\": \"sulfuric acid\"}}], \"new\": \"Source: KOMODO ModelSEED | ID: 119_11995 | DSMZ Medium: 119 (mediadive.medium:119) | Aerobic: No\\n\\nSuperseded historical provenance (not a current formulation claim):\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\\n\\nThe linked original uses anoxic preparation; its individual stock inputs and strain instructions must not silently replace this provider's reported medium rates.\\n\\nLinked original instruction (For DSM 1093, DSM 1125, DSM 11977, DSM 11978, DSM 11995, DSM 16643): Supplement medium after autoclaving with 1 ml/l Wolin's vitamin solution (10x, see medium 120), 0.30 g/l DL-dithiothreitol, and 0.15 g/l coenzyme M (2-mercaptoethanesulfonic acid) from anoxic stock solutions sterilized by filtration. Omit Na2S x 9 H2O and L-Cysteine HCl x H2O. This is a separate source/strain prescription, not an overwrite of the KOMODO table or new growth evidence. Any disagreement remains explicit.\\n\\nArchive all prior ingredient nodes, including false LB expansion, combined yeast amounts and copied or chemically inexact annotations, in append-only history. New nodes follow this exact source's stage and label; other unchanged chemical annotations are preserved, not recertified.\\n\\nSource-scoped recipe inputs supersede unsupported flattened concentrations and false LB identities. All prior history and permanent IDs remain unchanged; unquantified quantities remain unknown. No taxa-media association is added.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://komodo.modelseed.org/komodo/servlet/KomodoTomcatServerSideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=119_11995\", \"snippet\": \"2-Methylbutyric acid 2-methylbutyric acid 2-methylbutyric acid# 0.49 0.00\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[9].concentration\", \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"7.88845\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"new\": \"Source: KOMODO ModelSEED | ID: 119_11995 | DSMZ Medium: 119 (mediadive.medium:119) | Aerobic: No\\n\\nSuperseded historical provenance (not a current formulation claim):\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\\n\\nThe linked original uses anoxi