SideUtilitiesModelSeed?MediaInfo=119_7057\", \"snippet\": \"PH Info: null\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Source: KOMODO ModelSEED | ID: 119_7057 | DSMZ Medium: 119 (mediadive.medium:119) | Aerobic: No\\n\\nSuperseded historical provenance (not a current formulation claim):\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\\n\\nThe linked original uses anoxic preparation; its individual stock inputs and strain instructions must not silently replace this provider's reported medium rates.\\n\\nLinked original instruction (For DSM 7057): Supplement medium with 2.00 g/l Na2SO4. This is a separate source/strain prescription, not an overwrite of the KOMODO table or new growth evidence. Any disagreement remains explicit.\\n\\nArchive all prior ingredient nodes, including false LB expansion, combined yeast amounts and copied or chemically inexact annotations, in append-only history. New nodes follow this exact source's stage and label; other unchanged chemical annotations are preserved, not recertified.\\n\\nSource-scoped recipe inputs supersede unsupported flattened concentrations and false LB identities. All prior history and permanent IDs remain unchanged; unquantified quantities remain unknown. No taxa-media association is added.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium119.pdf\", \"snippet\": \"Sparge medium with 80%\\nH2 and 20% CO2 gas mixture for 30 - 45 min to make it anoxic.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Source: KOMODO ModelSEED | ID: 119_7057 | DSMZ Medium: 119 (mediadive.medium:119) | Aerobic: No\\n\\nSuperseded historical 