ate dihydrate\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"0.036\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:75213\", \"label\": \"sodium molybdate dihydrate\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"NaOH\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:32145\", \"label\": \"sodium hydroxide\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"0.5\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:32145\", \"label\": \"sodium hydroxide\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Na2SeO3 x 5 H2O\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:131361\", \"label\": \"disodium selenite pentahydrate\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"0.003\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:131361\", \"label\": \"disodium selenite pentahydrate\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Na2WO4 x 2 H2O\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:63939\", \"label\": \"sodium tungstate dihydrate\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"0.004\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:63939\", \"label\": \"sodium tungstate dihydrate\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Sludge\", \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"1000\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Isobutyric acid\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:16135\", \"label\": \"isobutyric acid\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"23\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"mediaingredientmech_chebi_term\": {\"id\": \"CHEBI:16135\", \"label\": \"isobutyric acid\"}}, {\"preferred_term\": \"Tryptone\", \"term\": {\"id\": \"MICRO:0000182\", \"label\": \"tryptone\"}, \"concentration\": {\"value\": \"10.0\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"supplier_catalog\": {\"supplier_name\": \"Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.) LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\", \"catalog_number\": \"Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\", \"product_url\": \"https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\"}, \"notes\": \"Pancreatic digest of casein providing amino acids, peptides, and nitrogen; Constituent of LB Medium (Luria-Be