\"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels (e.g., 20 ml of the medium in 120 ml serum bottles) under a stream of H2-CO2 (80:20, v/v) and seal with butyl rubber stoppers.\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[17].concentration\", \"field\": \"ingredients[13].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"variable\", \"unit\": \"VARIABLE\"}, \"new\": null, \"status\": \"remove_unsupported\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M258\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n          \\\"component_name\\\": \\\"N2\\\",\\n          \\\"gmo\\\": \\\"http://purl.jp/bio/10/gmo/GMO_002261\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[13].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Properties: Gas\\n\\nSource atmosphere context, not a fixed gas input or dissolved concentration. Removed the unsupported VARIABLE placeholder.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"Separately autoclave cysteine\\u00b7HCl and Na2S\\u00b79H2O as 5% solutions, respectively, under a N2 atmosphere.\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[18].concentration\", \"field\": \"ingredients[14].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"variable\", \"unit\": \"VARIABLE\"}, \"new\": null, \"status\": \"remove_unsupported\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M258\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n          \\\"component_name\\\": \\\"Hydrogen gas\\\",\\n          \\\"gmo\\\": \\\"http://purl.jp/bio/10/gmo/GMO_002263\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"ingredients[14].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Properties: Gas\\n\\nSource atmosphere context, not a fixed gas input or dissolved concentration. Removed the unsupported VARIABLE placeholder.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels (e.g., 20 ml of the medium in 120 ml serum bottles) under a stream of H2-CO2 (80:20, v/v) and seal with butyl rubber stoppers.\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[14].concentration\", \"field\": \"solutions[0].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"300\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"new\": {\"value\": \"0.3\", \"unit\": \"L\"}, \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M258\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n          \\\"component_name\\\": \\\"Rumen fluid, clarified (see below)\\\",\\n          \\\"volume\\\": 300,\\n          \\\"unit\\\": \\\"ml\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[0].concentration\", \"old\": null, \"new\": {\"value\": \"0.3\", \"unit\": \"L\"}, \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"Rumen fluid, clarified (see below) 300.0 ml\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[0].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Source stock addition: 300 ml = 0.3 L per receiving batch, not grams per liter or a dose per final liter.\\n\\nExpand only this named preparation, not the complete referenced medium. Water input does not establish final stock volume; no final-medium rate is inferred.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"To prepare the clarified rumen fluid,\"}, {\"old_field\": \"ingredients[19].concentration\", \"field\": \"solutions[0].composition[0].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"variable\", \"unit\": \"VARIABLE\"}, \"new\": null, \"status\": \"remove_unsupported\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M258\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n          \\\"component_name\\\": \\\"clarified rumen fluid\\\",\\n          \\\"gmo\\\": \\\"http://purl.jp/bio/10/gmo/GMO_001534\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[0].composition[0].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Role: Nutrient source; Properties: Undefined component\\n\\nUnquantified clarified-fluid product description, not an additional independent dose. The enclosing stock descriptor alone holds the 300 ml receiving-batch input. Removed the unsupported VARIABLE placeholder.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"To prepare the clarified rumen fluid, preheat rumen content at 120C for 15 min. Use the supernatant after centrifuging at 25,000 x g for 15 min.\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[0].preparation_notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"To prepare the clarified rumen fluid, preheat rumen content at 120C for 15 min. Use the supernatant after centrifuging at 25,000 x g for 15 min.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"To prepare the clarified rumen fluid, preheat rumen content at 120C for 15 min. Use the supernatant after centrifuging at 25,000 x g for 15 min.\"}, {\"old_field\": \"solutions[0].concentration\", \"field\": \"solutions[1].concentration\", \"old\": {\"value\": \"10\", \"unit\": \"G_PER_L\"}, \"new\": {\"value\": \"0.01\", \"unit\": \"L\"}, \"status\": \"correct\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M258\", \"snippet\": \"{\\n          \\\"component_name\\\": \\\"Trace minerals (see Medium [M142])\\\",\\n          \\\"volume\\\": 10,\\n          \\\"unit\\\": \\\"ml\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[1].concentration\", \"old\": null, \"new\": {\"value\": \"0.01\", \"unit\": \"L\"}, \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266\", \"snippet\": \"Trace minerals (see Medium No. 151) 10.0 ml\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[1].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Cross-reference to Medium M142\\n\\nSource stock addi